{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09037","headline":"晚出沣上赠崔都水 · 韦应物","name":"晚出沣上赠崔都水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临流一舒啸，望山意转延。\n隔林分落景，余霞明远川。\n首起趣东作，已看耘夏田。\n一从民里居，岁月再徂迁。\n昧质得全性，世名良自牵。\n行忻携手归，聊复饮酒眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}